for the identical job — two answers on one site, and an answer engine quotes
whichever it read first. The worked example is now computed in
data/guides.ts by calculateEstimate() across every city multiplier, so it
spans the GTA honestly and can never drift from the estimator again. Tests
added: the cost guide must quote the same catalogue bands as
data/services.ts priceFrom, and a retyped worked-example band fails.

